ly known  and irrefutable but the ground level  developers also  aren't going to make residuals their  names are not going to be bolstered or  lowered  by the success or failure of this game  the only names that will get a boost on  whether or not this game is purchased  and successful  are the franchise name of harry potter  and jk rowling her name is inextricably  tied to harry potter  legally financially and by influence  so for as many other people are as  involved in the franchise at this point  all the actors at this point video game  developers  no matter how they feel about who she is  and what she is doing  their work contributes to her ability to  keep doing it  and again that's not necessarily a  judgment call on those individuals  that's just the reality i'm not going to  judge the people who choose to buy and  play this game  i'm not i only ask that you not  do the cliche of saying well she wasn't  involved separate the artist from the  art it doesn't matter no it does  it does it matters  everything that bolsters the profile of  harry potter  bolsters her ability to keep hurting  people  which is something she's actively doing  every time she speaks out about trans  issues  and at this point it is immensely clear  that she is not going to stop  doing that so while  i have utter sympathy for the developers  who did this and however far up the  chain that goes  maybe someone like troy levitt did know  and did sign off of it in which case  good for him i have sympathy  i appreciate the work that you're doing  but you can't remove her from this  property  as long as she continues to speak about  trans issues  as long as she uses the fame  and the fact that she is the harry  potter creator  as a way to bolster a harmful  and hurtful voice far louder than it  should ever  be bolstered then supporting that  franchise  empowers her ability to do that these  things are  are messy and i get that the  developers want to be judged on their  work and i  trust that 