le others where it's a question  of are we going to punish them for  something they  did and that is a debate to be had  that's not even the question with  anything tied to harry potter and jk  rowling  the question here is are we going to  keep empowering her to continue to do it  people will make their own calls on that  whatever your thoughts are in regards to  this  as long as it isn't trying to argue with  me and try and tell me that jk rowling  is not in fact transphobic  drop something down in the comments and  let's talk about it  i have a patreon if you like what i do  this is in fact my living  it is how i pay my bills it's also my  birthday this month so that'd be a nice  present  um but you don't have to  like share subscribe they help me out as  well  and they would be greatly appreciated  but you don't  have to do any of it at the end of the  day you are the council  and i'm only running the meetings until  next time this council  is adjourned  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  so  [Music]  um  [Music]
 

